  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/IMG_88571.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>177 fotos del mi&eacute;rcoles en las fiestas de agosto de Tales, donde todo el protagonismo ha sido para la Uni&oacute;n de Pe&ntilde;as, organizadora de&nbsp;la entrada de vacas de la ganader&iacute;a de Armando Beltr&aacute;n, que se han exhibido por la tarde. De noche ha habido embolada y discom&oacute;vil en las antiguas escuelas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/uniopenyesdimecresfestesagosttales/img_8652.jpg\" alt=\"img_8652\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/uniopenyesdimecresfestesagosttales/img_8654.jpg\" alt=\"img_8654\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/uniopenyesdimecresfestesagosttales/img_8656.jpg\" alt=\"img_8656\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/uniopenyesdimecresfestesagosttales/img_8657.jpg\" alt=\"img_8657\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/uniopenyesdimecresfestesagosttales/img_8658.jpg\" alt=\"img_8658\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/uniopenyesdimecresfestesagosttales/img_8660.jpg\" alt=\"img_8660\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/uniopenyesdimecresfestesagosttales/img_8661.jpg\" alt=\"img_8661\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/uniopenyesdimecresfestesagosttales/img_8662.jpg\" alt=\"img_8662\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4